   "en": "Gentoku, the head of the AI conglomerate Dennoin family, has passed away.\nHis three children watch with bated breath to see what becomes of their father's vast fortune.\nHowever, the heir named in the will turns out to be, of all things, a care robot named Loppy?!\n\n(Source: MangaPlus)",
